    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Pharitu in ancient times had it rough. Their world was once calm, but due to unknown geological causes it moprhed into one of the most electrically potent places in the known universe. To stand a chance of survival the species was forced to adapt rapidly or face certain extinction.",
    "value": "远古时期的法瑞图生存极为艰难。他们的世界曾一度平静，却因未知的地质剧变，成为了已知宇宙中电性最为活跃的场所之一。为了争取一线生机，这个种族被迫在急速适应与彻底灭绝之间做出抉择。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Forced underground just to survive, the Pharitu did indeed begin to change. Over the course of only a few thousand years, they begin to exhibit unusual capabilities that have thus far not been replicated by any known creatures in the galaxy.",
    "value": "仅仅是为了生存而被迫转入地下，法瑞图就此开始了蜕变。在短短数千年的演化历程中，他们逐渐展现出种种异常能力，迄今为止，星系内尚无任何已知生物能够复现。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Their minds possess exceptional powers capable of projecting through most stone when fueled by energy from their Shakta, the natural gem formations that contain the essence which fuels their lives. Through this energy they can 'cut' into stone",
    "value": "他们的思维拥有超凡的力量，当其生命能量之源，一种名为“沙克塔”的天然宝石为其提供能量时，便能穿透大多数岩石。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "allowing them the ability to shape it as no other known species can. Stories telling of the beauty these beings are able to create through sculpture cannot be overstated: what they can create borders on the impossible.",
    "value": "凭借这种能量，他们可以“切割”石块，并如同塑造黏土般对其进行塑形，这是其他任何已知物种都无法企及的。关于这些生物通过雕塑所能创造的美的故事，无论如何形容都不为过：他们的造物，已臻至不可能的边缘。"
